## Conflicts with other docs / series

**PM tip vs SPRINT tip drift** → re-pin both after merge; SPRINT is “now,” PM follows within one landing.
**DESIGN marketing vs PM honesty** → never copy DESIGN slogans into PM `done` without product proof.

